WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.916
Slice one point five builds the design system's feedback, overlays and content,

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:07.527
once.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.742
Twenty-one components, each under its design-system name: alerts, toasts, dialogs,

00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:17.333
menus, cards, lists, tables, tabs and messages.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:19.235
Every screen will reuse them.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.387
A danger alert is announced at once, with role alert. Good news waits politely, as a

00:00:25.387 --> 00:00:26.136
status.

00:00:26.336 --> 00:00:30.913
The toast region keeps one polite live region, and an alert for each failure.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.063
The dialog and drawer are shells for the CDK Dialog a screen will open.

00:00:37.263 --> 00:00:42.398
The menu button moves with the arrow keys, Home and End, and Escape returns focus to

00:00:42.398 --> 00:00:43.432
its trigger.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.127
Pagination and tabs are real links, marked with aria current, so Back and new tabs

00:00:49.127 --> 00:00:50.115
still work.

00:00:50.315 --> 00:00:54.678
The table has a caption and column headers, and scrolls in its own region.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.183
No screen uses them yet, so each is proven through the page: roles, names, focus and

00:01:01.183 --> 00:01:01.792
keys.

00:01:01.992 --> 00:01:06.855
A hundred and forty tests pass. Each key rule was broken on purpose, and its test

00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:07.695
went red.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.095
And nothing grew. Both apps start exactly as before, well inside their two hundred

00:01:13.095 --> 00:01:15.508
and seventy-five kilobyte budgets.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.805
Next, slice one point six moves every built screen onto these components.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.093
That's slice one point five. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:31.093 --> 00:01:32.375
body and spirit.
